~ intro
do play_and_wait("printer_enter")
do play("printer_idle")
printer: O-oh hi
printer: A new robot worker?
printer: I had a crazy day yesterday and-[next=auto] [#anim=happy]
printer: ... [#anim=idle]
printer: Oh right.
printer: O-one large coffee please
=> END!

~ large_coffee
printer: Okay you got me, I can't actually drink coffee
printer: That's not why I am here
printer: I-I know we aren't supposed to show emotions, b-but...
printer: Somebody ordered to print a document 400 times
printer: It's clearly an error, but I can't tell them that! [#anim=sad]

automat: [color=#1bffc2]W-wait![/color]

do play("heart_unlocked")
do wait(3)
do play_and_wait("heart_gain")
do play("Lock3")
=> END!

~ medium_coffee
printer: I cant drink this!
printer: Its medium!
=> END!

~ duck
printer: Ah
printer: Quack
=> END!

~ compass
printer: Oh... uhm
printer: Yeah, uhm. Sure!
=> END!

~ mind
printer: I print!
printer: Letters, numbers mostly.
=> END!

~ silence
printer: ...
=> END!

~ heart_final
printer: Huh?
printer: O-okay! [#anim=happy]
printer: I CAN do this!
printer: I will tell them off! [#anim=super_happy]
do play("printer_particles")
printer: PRRRRRRRR
do wait(3)
do play_and_wait("printer_leave")
=> END!

~ second_large_coffee
printer: Oh thanks, but
printer: I don't drink
do play("printer", "sad")
=> END!

~ second_medium
printer: Oh no that's okay, thank you
do play("printer", "sad")
=> END!

~ second_duck
printer: I like her
do play("printer", "sad")
=> END!

~ second_mind
printer: Yeah... that's true
do play("printer", "sad")
=> END!

~ second_other
printer: ...
